<title>USA: Lexington Global Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Lexington Global Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>LEXINGTON GLOBAL ASSET MANAGERS INC.</p>
<p>	     THIRD QUARTER RESULTS NOV. 6, 1996</p>
<p>			  THIRD QUARTER	     THIRD QUARTER</p>
<p>			     3 MONTHS		   9 MONTHS</p>
<p>				  Pro Forma	     Pro Forma</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Total revenues $5,565,017 $5,440,059 $16,888,376 $16,006,713</p>
<p> Net income	  789,326    404,651   1,730,102   1,434,283</p>
<p> Earnings per share   0.14	 0.07	  0.31	  0.26</p>
<p>Note: Lexington Global Asset Managers Inc. went public on Dec.</p>
<p>13, 1995 when it was spun off from Piedmont Management</p>
<p>Company, Inc. Earnings per share for the third quarter of 1995</p>
<p>have been calculated assuming the same number of shares</p>
<p>outstanding as of Dec. 31, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
